  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wNf00fvN/lios-overhauled-villages.png\" alt=\"lios-overhauled-villages\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">歡迎來到<strong>Lio's Overhauled Villages</strong>！這個模組為村莊帶來更現代且充滿活力的氛圍。享受升級後的建築、互動元素，以及在每個村莊圖書館中等待被發現的隱藏秘密，帶給你沉浸式的遊戲體驗。<br><br></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FkZp6Lwt/villages.png\" alt=\"villages\" width=\"434\" height=\"55\"></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>平原村莊</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>針葉林村莊</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>沙漠村莊</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>莽原村莊</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>雪原村莊</strong></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mrsKQ5m4/compatibility.png\" alt=\"compatibility\" width=\"645\" height=\"55\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>此模組與大多數其他模組相容，並應可與任何村莊附加模組搭配使用。不過，你可能在尋找專門的相容性支援，可以在這裡找到！</em></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">-&gt; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/lios-universal-village-compat-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lio's Village Compatibility Datapack</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12)\"><a style=\"display:flex;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lioloader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wrK85wgc/logo.png\" alt=\"LioLoader\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n<div style=\"text-align:left;line-height:1.35\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">需要基於資料包的設定？</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14px\">查看 <strong>LioLoader</strong>，獲得全域資料包/資源包載入功能。支援 <strong>NeoForge</strong> 和 <strong>Fabric</strong>，適用於 <strong>Minecraft 1.21.x</strong>。</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px\">在 CurseForge 上開啟 LioLoader →</div>\n</div>\n</a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3530fDGj/hidden-secrets-and-easter-eggs.png\" alt=\"hidden-secrets-and-easter-eggs\"></p><ul>\n<li><strong>圖書館之謎：</strong>探索村莊圖書館，揭開隱藏的秘密，發現精心設計的彩蛋。</li>\n<li><strong>互動發現：</strong>與新的互動元素互動，觸發特殊事件或獲得有價值的獎勵。</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/seMy8\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cvqfFqD/lovbisect.png\" alt=\"lovbisect\" width=\"803\" height=\"77\"></a></p><p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fV6VtS4Q/youtube-reviews.png\" alt=\"youtube-reviews\" width=\"605\" height=\"44\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n<p>-於 17:25 處評論-</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4GQ9mz_q8ko?t=1045\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>-於 9:54 處評論-</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nFs0BDD85kw?t=595s\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>-於 2:52 處評論-<br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VTaizc8Gsmc?t=172s\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sPHes7q4Pr\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qDNhg49/636e0a6a49cf127bf92de1e2-icon-clyde-blurple-RGB.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"97\"><br></a></h2><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/DPxQHNKk/usage.png\" alt=\"usage\" width=\"692\" height=\"48\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">歡迎在任何你喜歡的 Minecraft 模組包中使用<strong>Lio's Overhauled Villages</strong>。我們鼓勵你將我們的模組整合到自訂的模組包中，創造多樣且精彩的遊戲體驗。無需請求明確許可，只需以符合你遊戲風格的方式享受這些煥然一新的村莊！</p>",
